// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P899280807" "The paper is full of stories about {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup}. Maybe it's time someone brought him down a peg."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1863568069" "Arachnos is on a crackdown against the {VillainGroup}. Busting a few heads should earn you some brownie points with the spiders."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1294085368" "The {VillainGroup} made a powerful enemy lately. Bashing a few of their heads in might win you some points with their enemies."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3382071859" "{Boss_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} has been getting a lot of press lately. You figure beating him like a dog in front of his own men ought to show everyone who runs this town."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1551071898" "Ah. Music to your ears. Arachnos is offering a bounty on this idiot. Taking down {Boss_Name} will be easy money."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3846354228" "Hmm. Beating {BOSS_NAME} into a little greasy spot is hardly worth your attention, but it might kill some time while you wait on something bigger."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P3373206310" "{BOSS_NAME} is legendary? Since when? The last you heard of this two-bit punk he was stealing purses in Paragon City. The Rogue Isles are too crowded already. Time to send this jerk back to Capeville."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P4076269910" "{BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} just hit a bank nearby. It's not hard to figure out where they're holed up. A quick trip and a little violence and you could nab the cash for yourself."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P908455237" "Some days it's good just to pick some random foe and beat the snot out of him. Keeps the rest of the villains in this town afraid of you. Tonight is the {VillainGroup}'s turn."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2106593068" "Looks like a guy you did time with is now a leader in the {VillainGroup}. You didn't like {BOSS_NAME} in the can, and you don't like him now."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P409797511" "A former do-gooder named {BOSS_NAME} has decided crime does pay after all. He's taken off the cape and cowl and is working for {VillainGroup}. It'd be great to 'introduce yourself' to this former crusader and show him who runs these isles."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1895319766" "Can you believe this jerk? He went to the press and called you out. Well if it's a fight he wants, it's a fight he'll get."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2494094665" "What the--no way. Someone's setting you up with Arachnos. Someone who's gonna pay. Hard. Maybe if you put one of the {VillainGroup} in the morgue they'll learn not to spread lies about you."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P1261999780" "Like spit he does. This ends now."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P627543014" "{BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup} has called you out right in front of everyone. You'd best not let something like that slip."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2984743849" "They think {BOSS_NAME} is terrifying? Wait'll they get a load of you."
// Script Variable INTRODUCTION_STRING :
"P2371838818" "The local rag thinks you’ve disappeared just because you haven't made any big noises lately. You should pick on someone. Say {BOSS_NAME} of the {VillainGroup}, and remind folks you're still around."
