"P1933226961" "Watch your back. Don't underestimate {BOSS_NAME}."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P3625684112" "Do this quick and word will spread that you're the Top Dog in this town."
// Script Variable SEND_OFF_STRING :
"P1418642229" "Blood and bones. That's what it's all about."
